      "name": "slack_create_canvas",
      "args": {
        "title": "Zoo Visit Checklist",
        "channel": "C0C7SGC3VPT",
        "markdown": "## Before you go\n\n- [ ] Check zoo hours, admission, parking, and any timed-entry requirements\n- [ ] Review the weather and zoo map\n- [ ] Choose must-see animals, exhibits, shows, and keeper talks\n- [ ] Buy tickets or confirm membership/reservations\n- [ ] Plan transportation and arrival time\n- [ ] Charge phones/cameras and download tickets\n\n## Pack\n\n- [ ] Comfortable walking shoes\n- [ ] Weather-appropriate layers\n- [ ] Refillable water bottles\n- [ ] Sunscreen, hats, and sunglasses\n- [ ] Snacks, if permitted\n- [ ] Stroller or mobility aids, if needed\n- [ ] Small first-aid kit and any medications\n- [ ] Portable charger\n- [ ] Hand sanitizer or wipes\n\n## At the zoo\n\n- [ ] Pick up or open the zoo map\n- [ ] Note show, feeding, and talk times\n- [ ] Set a meeting point in case the group separates\n- [ ] Take breaks and refill water\n- [ ] Follow animal-safety rules and stay behind barriers\n- [ ] Leave time for restrooms, meals, and the gift shop\n\n## Before leaving\n\n- [ ] Check that everyone has phones, bags, and souvenirs\n- [ ] Recycle or dispose of trash\n- [ ] Save favorite photos and note exhibits to revisit",
        "idempotencyKey": "2c466171-11cb-43d0-8d14-56f49ae709de"
